      "official_mark_scheme_text": "$E(X)=0+1(1/16)+2(3/16)+3(5/16)+4(4/16)=38/16=19/8$. M1FT; accept unsimplified with probabilities $0<p<1$ adding to 1; may be calculated in variance; FT their table with four or five probabilities adding to 1. $\\operatorname{Var}(X)=1^2(1/16)+2^2(3/16)+3^2(5/16)+4^2(4/16)-(19/8)^2=122/16-(19/8)^2=127/64=1\\frac{63}{64}=1.98$. M1FT appropriate variance formula using their $[E(X)]^2$; FT their table with four or more probabilities, $0<p<1$, need not sum to 1, or expression no more evaluated than shown. A1; accept 1.984375 to 3 or more SF. SCB1 for 1.98 if M0 M1 scored. Total: 3.",
